L8MWR8tSWAxVvia8BHT5kHfIQ3IcHCHkoFw",null,null,null,null,null,1,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_PRICE_RANGE"],"每個人平均花費多少？",[[[["E:TWD_200_TO_400"],"$200-400",2,null,"$200 到 $400","0ahUKEwjL8MWR8tSWAxVvia8BHT5kHfIQ3YcHCHwoAA"]],1],null,null,"平均每人消費金額",null,"0ahUKEwjL8MWR8tSWAxVvia8BHT5kHfIQ3IcHCHsoGA",null,null,null,null,null,1,[[2]],2],[["GUIDED_DINING_DISH_RECOMMENDATION"],"你推薦哪道料理？",null,[[[["M:/g/11zkpz_v_n"],"味玉神山拉麵",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjL8MWR8tSWAxVvia8BHT5kHfIQ3YcHCH4oAA"]],[1]],null,"建議的餐點",null,"0ahUKEwjL8MWR8tSWAxVvia8BHT5kHfIQ3IcHCH0oGQ",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_GROUP_SIZE"],"這裡適合幾個人的聚會？",null,[[[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_ONE"],"1 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjL8MWR8tSWAxVvia8BHT5kHfIQ3YcHCIABKAA"],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_TWO"],"2 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjL8MWR8tSWAxVvia8BHT5kHfIQ3YcHCIEBKAE"],[["E:DINING_GROUP_SIZE_THREE_TO_FOUR"],"3 到 4 人",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjL8MWR8tSWAxVvia8BHT5kHfIQ3YcHCIIBKAI"]]],null,"用餐人數",null,"0ahUKEwjL8MWR8tSWAxVvia8BHT5kHfIQ3IcHCH8oGg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["麵屋武藏在台北的三家分店之一，位於條通巷內，平日中午來坐不到半滿，應該是天氣太熱了，店內冷氣也不怎麼涼。這家點餐不是用拉麵機，而是帶位入座後掃碼點餐，餐後櫃檯結帳。\n麵屋武藏的特色就是每家分店的品項和限定款都有所不同，之前吃過信義店限定，這次來就不點限定款，選擇招牌的味玉神山拉麵($330)，有大塊叉燒和溏心蛋各一，可以免費加麵半球，中捲麵的麵體本身偏硬有勁道，嚼起來十分過癮，忍不住叫了聲好！\n神山拉麵是採魚介和豚骨雙湯頭，平衡得很好，偏魚介多一點，喝起來很順口，不過還是偏鹹，想吃清淡可以索取免費的清高湯稀釋。\n豬五花叉燒是一大亮點，方形紮實的叉燒有微甜調味和炙燒香味，咬起來非常Q彈緊實，卻又不油膩，實在厲害！另外溏心蛋超濃郁的蛋黃也滿喜歡的，整體真的不錯，老牌拉麵店的水準依舊穩定。\n\n#Lev",null,[0,82]]]],[null,1783481669000000,1783481669000000,"1 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfUmprZzJJa04wZGY4MWFFSlZqMllfZw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiLwoZQ0hfUmprZzJJa04wZGY4MWFFSlZqMllfZxoSQ2dzSXhZcTMwZ1lRam9yZ0N3\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjL8MWR8tSWAxVvia8BHT5kHfIQ_2MIgwEoGw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/4634296749281698316/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnBHZEdReVNtWk9NMDV5Vld4S2RWVXlhR2haVlU1TFkyNWtWVk5XUlJBQhA